        "template": "bfd pst bind peer-ip [parameter1] interface [parameter2]",
        "command": "bfd pst bind peer-ip 10.1.1.2 interface GigabitEthernet1/0/0",
        "explanation": "Configure BFD sessions, bind the peer IP address to 10.1.1.2 and interface to GigabitEthernet1/0/0",
